            "type": "text",
            "text": "Today, I went out to explore the city. I started my day by visiting a beautiful park near my house. There is a large fountain in the center of the park, and there are many colorful flowers around it. After the park, I walked to the nearby bank. The bank is next to a small café where I had a delicious breakfast. Then, I needed to go to the library. I asked a passerby, \"Excuse me, can you tell me how to get to the library?\" He said, \"Go straight for two blocks, then turn right. The library is on the corner next to a restaurant.\" I followed his directions and soon arrived at the library."
